WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.912
After Taikang lost power, Hou Yi took control of Xia.

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:09.302
Hou Yi of the Youqiong clan became the ruler in all but name.

00:00:09.652 --> 00:00:13.204
Hou Yi was a master of archery who never missed his target.

00:00:13.554 --> 00:00:17.274
His military power was so great that no one dared oppose him.

00:00:17.624 --> 00:00:22.400
But Hou Yi spent his time hunting and never built a stable rule.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:27.742
He left many matters in the hands of Han Zhuo, the aide at his side.

00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:33.084
Han Zhuo seemed loyal on the surface, but he had plans of his own.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:37.346
Little by little he won Hou Yi's trust, and a share of his power.

00:00:37.696 --> 00:00:42.688
Hou Yi gradually let down his guard, unaware that danger was closing in.

00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:47.550
In secret, Han Zhuo prepared to seize Hou Yi's power for himself.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.980
In the end, Han Zhuo took Hou Yi's power away.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:58.450
The struggle for power in early Xia was still not over.

